close_reason: "Rolled out the reviewed pilot (unbraind/pm-presets#118, auto-merge proven on pm-presets#119, groups made disjoint in pm-presets#120). This PR's required checks gate the merge; repository auto-merge and branch deletion enabled."
body: Fleet-wide automation of version bumps; see companion pm-cli-website-6d05.
